cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "ExactStream: a 125B mixture-of-experts model on a 64 GB Mac"
authors:
  - family-names: Levi
    given-names: Kamen
version: 1.0.1
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/kamenlevi/exactstream
abstract: >-
  An engine that runs Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (125B parameters, 512 experts per layer) on a 64 GB Mac by streaming the
  experts from the internal SSD into fixed memory pools. Its exact configs
  produce tokens bitwise equal to the exact reference; its lossy configs are labelled by gates on the model's known
  benchmarks.
keywords:
  - mixture-of-experts
  - speculative decoding
  - SSD streaming
  - Apple silicon
  - MLX
